 n_x1s: x1s, -6!0000000000000

Index g
#  No factors: fam_dig is wired with G = nullptr and tsvcomp-dig.inc declares no
#  TC_dig_G.  A digit's sign is fam_sgn's whole job, so there is no sign
#  counter here to give a context to.
